5,"Tibetan Music, Tibetan Songs - Tibet Travel",https://www.tibetguru.com/tibetan-arts/tibetan-music.htm,"Singing, loud and sonorous, has romantic color, expressing the Tibetans religious belief and their enjoying happy lives and peaceful minds.",Sunwar,Sino-Tibetan
6,Songs and Music of Tibet | Smithsonian Folkways Recordings,https://folkways.si.edu/songs-and-music-of-tibet/world/album/smithsonian,"From a camp in the outskirts of Kathmandu, Howard Kaufman captures the essence of Tibetan chants. Kaufman gathers songs that are ""excerpts from much longer versions of both Eastern and Western Tibet"".",Sunwar,Sino-Tibetan
